These are the unmodified public headers of X11 (Xlib, Xt; MIT/X11 licence)
and Motif 2.3 (LGPL 2.1), copied so that Motif programs compile against the
genuine API. The only change: Xm/XmStrDefs.h, X11/StringDefs.h and
X11/Shell.h default to their string-literal mode (XMSTRINGDEFINES /
XTSTRINGDEFINES). Nothing here needs an X server: the functions they declare
are implemented on Qt by this project.
